# DotApp Config

Full reference: `AIRULES/10-CONFIG-AND-SECRETS.md`.

## This file is editable

`app/config.php` is the **only** core file agents may edit. Do not touch `app/parts/`.

## New install secrets (when user asks)

Generate with `bin2hex(random_bytes(32))` and set:

- `Config::set("app","name", 'UniqueName')`
- `Config::set("app","c_enc_key", ...)`
- `Config::set("app","rm_key", ...)`
- `Config::set("app","rmrcm_key", ...)`

Replace placeholders `YourSuperSecretKey`, `RememberMe :)`.  
`/* @AUTOCONFIG */` does **not** auto-generate keys.

## Database

```php
Config::addDatabase("main", $host, $user, $pass, $db, "UTF8", "MYSQL", "pdo");
```

## Module overrides

```php
Config::module("Shop", "apikey", "production-value");
```

Modules **MUST** define fallbacks in **`defaultSettings()`** and call it from `initializeRoutes()` + `initialize()` (`AIRULES/00` §2m).

## Session hardening

`Config::session("secure", true)` on HTTPS; keep httponly + SameSite Strict.

App session **values** still go through `DSM::use('Shop')` — never `$_SESSION` / `session_start()` (`AIRULES/20`).
